          "filename": "Gates blocking Weardale Railway bridge across the Wear at Stanhope. 04 07 2018.jpg",
          "caption": "View west along the tracks of the Weardale Railway west of Stanhope station. This line continues to the site of the Lafarge Cement Works at Eastgate but is yet to be reopened to passenger services and is thus trains rarely pass along it. This appears to be the reason that the line is blocked by gates at this point, just before it crosses the wear over the first bridge west of Stanhope (immediately behind the gates).",
          "alt": "View west along the tracks of the Weardale Railway west of Stanhope station. This line continues to the site of the Lafarge Cement Works at Eastgate but is yet to be reopened to passenger services and is thus trains rarely pass along it. This appears to be the reason that the line is blocked by gates at this point, just before it crosses the wear over the first bridge west of Stanhope (immediately behind the gates).",
